      "dedupe_key": "brian-clemens-big-band-ft-francesca-confortini-20th-century-jukebox|2027-02-11|wiltons-music",
      "description": "Los Angeles-born pianist, arranger and composer Brian Clemens and vocal jazz star Francesca Confortini return to Wilton’s Music Hall with The 20th Century Jukebox, two nights celebrating an eclectic mix of music from across the century. From classic swing and the Great American Songbook to Hollywood, James Bond, Motown, The Beatles, pop, rock and beyond, the Brian Clemens Big Band puts its own stamp on some of the century’s most memorable music. Familiar favourites sit alongside unexpected choices, original songs and bold new arrangements, brought to life by a roaring big band featuring some of London’s finest musicians. Following previous Wilton’s performances and UK theatre dates with Songs of the Silver Screen and Broadway to the West End, Clemens and Confortini return with a programme that brings together audience favourites and new surprises. Praised by The Spy in the Stalls as “a whirlwind ride through the music world,” the show showcases the musical chemistry between Clemens and Confortini, whose powerful vocals have been heard alongside artists including Cat Stevens and Rod Stewart.",
      "ends_at": "2027-02-12T21:00:00Z",
